{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04541","headline":"奉和圣制送宇文融安辑户口应制 · 张说","name":"奉和圣制送宇文融安辑户口应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"至德临天下，劳情遍九围。\n念兹人去本，蓬转将何依。\n外避征戍数，内伤亲党稀。\n嗟不逢明盛，胡能照隐微。\n柏台简行李，兰殿锡朝衣。\n别曲动秋风，恩令生春辉。\n使出四海安，诏下万心归。\n怍非夔龙佐，徒歌鸿雁飞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04541.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04541","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}